[{"id":"fm-core2-2.23-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Express <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{2}{x(x^2+2)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{A}{x}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac2{x(x^2+2)} \\equiv\\frac Ax+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+2},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2 =A(x^2+2)+(Bx+C)x.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2=2A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\text{Let }x=1:\\quad2=3A+B+C,\\quad\\text{so }B+C=-1.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\text{Let }x=2:\\quad2=6A+4B+2C,\\quad\\text{so }4B+2C=-4,\\quad\\therefore B=-1,\\ C=0.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Therefore</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac2{x(x^2+2)}=\\frac1x-\\frac{x}{x^2+2}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.23-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Express <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{3x^2-x+10}{(x+1)(x^2+1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{A}{x+1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{3x^2-x+10}{(x+1)(x^2+1)} \\equiv\\frac A{x+1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3x^2-x+10 =A(x^2+1)+(Bx+C)(x+1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"10=A+C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\text{Let }x=1:\\quad12=2A+2B+2C,\\quad\\text{so }6=A+B+C,\\quad\\therefore B=-4.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"20=5A+6B+3C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, giving <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=7\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{3x^2-x+10}{(x+1)(x^2+1)}=\\frac7{x+1}-\\frac{4x-3}{x^2+1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.23-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>A student is trying to express a rational function in partial fractions. Their working is shown below:</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{3x^2+5x+5}{(x+1)(x^2+2)}=\\frac{A}{x+1}+\\frac{B}{x^2+2}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Explain the mistake made by the student.</p></li><li><p>Express <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{3x^2+5x+5}{(x+1)(x^2+2)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> correctly as partial fractions.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>The term in the numerator of the fraction with denominator <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x^2+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> should be of the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"Bx+C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{3x^2+5x+5}{(x+1)(x^2+2)} \\equiv\\frac A{x+1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+2},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3x^2+5x+5 =A(x^2+2)+(Bx+C)(x+1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5=2A+C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\text{Let }x=1:\\quad13=3A+2B+2C,\\qquad\n\\text{let }x=2:\\quad27=6A+6B+3C.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Solving gives <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{3x^2+5x+5}{(x+1)(x^2+2)}=\\frac1{x+1}+\\frac{2x+3}{x^2+2}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.23-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Write each of the following as partial fractions:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{x+5}{(x^2+1)(x+1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{5x}{(2x+1)(x^2+1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{x-2}{(x+3)(x^2+4)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{3x^2-6x+15}{(2x^2+1)(x-1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{25x^2}{2x^3-3x^2+8x-12}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{x^2}{x^3-3x^2+5x-15}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{1}{(x^2+k)(x-1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive constant.</p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{k}{(x^2+k)(x-k)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive constant.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{x+5}{(x^2+1)(x+1)} \\equiv\\frac A{x+1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx+5 =A(x^2+1)+(Bx+C)(x+1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5=A+C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6=2A+2B+2C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"7=5A+6B+3C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{x+5}{(x^2+1)(x+1)}=\\frac2{x+1}+\\frac{-2x+3}{x^2+1}=\\frac2{x+1}-\\frac{2x-3}{x^2+1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{5x}{(2x+1)(x^2+1)} \\equiv\\frac A{2x+1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n5x =A(x^2+1)+(Bx+C)(2x+1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0=A+C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5=2A+3B+3C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"10=5A+10B+5C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{5x}{(2x+1)(x^2+1)}=-\\frac2{2x+1}+\\frac{x+2}{x^2+1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{x-2}{(x+3)(x^2+4)} \\equiv\\frac A{x+3}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+4},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx-2 =A(x^2+4)+(Bx+C)(x+3).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-2=4A+3C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-1=5A+4B+4C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0=8A+10B+5C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=-\\frac5{13}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=\\frac5{13}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=-\\frac2{13}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{x-2}{(x+3)(x^2+4)}=-\\frac5{13(x+3)}+\\frac{5x-2}{13(x^2+4)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{3x^2-6x+15}{(2x^2+1)(x-1)} \\equiv\\frac A{x-1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{2x^2+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3x^2-6x+15 =A(2x^2+1)+(Bx+C)(x-1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"15=A-C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12=3A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=-11\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"15=9A+2B+C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, giving <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{3x^2-6x+15}{(2x^2+1)(x-1)}=\\frac4{x-1}-\\frac{5x+11}{2x^2+1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=2x^3-3x^2+8x-12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nf\\left(\\frac32\\right)=\\frac{27}{4}-\\frac{27}{4}+12-12=0,\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>therefore <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(2x-3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a factor. Thus</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2x^3-3x^2+8x-12=(2x-3)(x^2+4).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{25x^2}{2x^3-3x^2+8x-12} =\\frac{25x^2}{(2x-3)(x^2+4)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\equiv\\frac A{2x-3}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+4},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n25x^2 =A(x^2+4)+(Bx+C)(2x-3).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0=4A-3C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"25=5A-B-C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"100=8A+2B+C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=9\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{25x^2}{2x^3-3x^2+8x-12}=\\frac9{2x-3}+\\frac{8x+12}{x^2+4}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(x)=x^3-3x^2+5x-15\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f(3)=27-27+15-15=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, therefore <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(x-3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a factor. Hence</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx^3-3x^2+5x-15=(x-3)(x^2+5).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{x^2}{x^3-3x^2+5x-15} \\equiv\\frac A{x-3}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+5},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx^2 =A(x^2+5)+(Bx+C)(x-3).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0=5A-3C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=6A-2B-2C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4=9A-2B-C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\frac9{14}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=\\frac5{14}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=\\frac{15}{14}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{x^2}{x^3-3x^2+5x-15}=\\frac9{14(x-3)}+\\frac{5x+15}{14(x^2+5)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">g)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac1{(x^2+k)(x-1)} \\equiv\\frac A{x-1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+k},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1 =A(x^2+k)+(Bx+C)(x-1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=kA-C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=(k+1)A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\frac1{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=\\frac{k}{k+1}-1=-\\frac1{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Compare squared terms: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0=A+B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\frac1{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-\\frac1{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=-\\frac1{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac1{(x^2+k)(x-1)}=\\frac1{(k+1)(x-1)}-\\frac{x+1}{(k+1)(x^2+k)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">f)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{k}{(x^2+k)(x-k)} \\equiv\\frac A{x-k}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+k},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1 =A(x^2+k)+(Bx+C)(x-k).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=kA-kC\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=(k^2+k)A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\frac1{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=\\frac{k(1/(k+1))-1}{k}=-\\frac{k}{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Compare squared terms: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0=A+B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\frac1{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-\\frac1{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=-\\frac{k}{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{k}{(x^2+k)(x-k)}=\\frac1{(k+1)(x-k)}-\\frac{x+k}{(k+1)(x^2+k)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.23-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>It is known that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{6x^2+5x+6}{x^3+kx}\\equiv\\frac{A}{x}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+k},\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are positive integers. Determine the possible values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. <strong>The following questions require the use of Partial Fractions and A-Level Maths Integration Methods.</strong></p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{6x^2+5x+6}{x^3+kx} \\equiv\\frac Ax+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+k},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n6x^2+5x+6 =A(x^2+k)+(Bx+C)x.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6=kA\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\frac6k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive integer, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=1,2,3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or 6.</p>","<p>Compare quadratic terms: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6=A+B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"6=\\frac6k+B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=6-\\frac6k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive integer, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=2,3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or 6. Compare linear terms: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"5=C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k=6\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.23-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Find each of the following in simplified form:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{18}{(x-1)(x+2)(x-4)}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{x-2}{(x-1)^2}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{7x}{(2x-1)(x+3)^2}\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{18}{(x-1)(x+2)(x-4)} \\equiv\\frac A{x-1}+\\frac B{x+2}+\\frac C{x-4},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n18 =A(x+2)(x-4)+B(x-1)(x-4)+C(x-1)(x+2).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"18=-9A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"18=18B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"18=18C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{18}{(x-1)(x+2)(x-4)}\\,dx\n =\\int\\left(-\\frac2{x-1}+\\frac1{x+2}+\\frac1{x-4}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-2\\ln|x-1|+\\ln|x+2|+\\ln|x-4|+c\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\ln|(x-1)^2|+\\ln|(x+2)(x-4)|+c\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\left|\\frac{(x+2)(x-4)}{(x-1)^2}\\right|+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{x-2}{(x-1)^2} \\equiv\\frac A{x-1}+\\frac B{(x-1)^2},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx-2 =A(x-1)+B.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-1=B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-2=-A+B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{x-2}{(x-1)^2}\\,dx\n =\\int\\left(\\frac1{x-1}-\\frac1{(x-1)^2}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\int\\left(\\frac1{x-1}-(x-1)^{-2}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln|x-1|+(x-1)^{-1}+c\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln|x-1|+\\frac1{x-1}+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{7x}{(2x-1)(x+3)^2} \\equiv\\frac A{2x-1}+\\frac B{x+3}+\\frac C{(x+3)^2},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n7x =A(x+3)^2+B(2x-1)(x+3)+C(2x-1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac72=\\frac{49}{4}A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\frac27\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-21=-7C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"0=9A-3B-C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-\\frac17\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{7x}{(2x-1)(x+3)^2}\\,dx\n =\\int\\left(\\frac{2}{7(2x-1)}-\\frac1{7(x+3)}+\\frac3{(x+3)^2}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac17\\ln|2x-1|-\\frac17\\ln|x+3|-3(x+3)^{-1}+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.23-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{3x^2+x+4}{(x+1)(x^2+2)}\\,dx=\\ln\\left((x+1)^2\\sqrt{x^2+2}\\right)+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{3x^2+x+4}{(x+1)(x^2+2)} \\equiv\\frac A{x+1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+2},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3x^2+x+4 =A(x^2+2)+(Bx+C)(x+1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4=2A+C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"8=3A+2B+2C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"18=6A+6B+3C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{3x^2+x+4}{(x+1)(x^2+2)}\\,dx\n =\\int\\left(\\frac2{x+1}+\\frac{x}{x^2+2}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =2\\ln|x+1|+\\frac12\\ln|x^2+2|+c\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln|(x+1)^2|+\\ln|\\sqrt{x^2+2}|+c\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\left((x+1)^2\\sqrt{x^2+2}\\right)+c,\\quad\\text{as required.}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.23-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_1^4\\frac{x^2-4x+15}{(x+1)(x^2+3)}\\,dx=\\ln\\frac{3125}{722}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{x^2-4x+15}{(x+1)(x^2+3)} \\equiv\\frac A{x+1}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+3},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nx^2-4x+15 =A(x^2+3)+(Bx+C)(x+1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"15=3A+C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12=4A+2B+2C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"11=7A+6B+3C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{x^2-4x+15}{(x+1)(x^2+3)}=\\frac5{x+1}-\\frac{4x}{x^2+3}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_1^4\\frac{x^2-4x+15}{(x+1)(x^2+3)}\\,dx\n =\\int_1^4\\left(\\frac5{x+1}-\\frac{4x}{x^2+3}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =[5\\ln|x+1|-2\\ln|x^2+3|]_1^4\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =(5\\ln5-2\\ln19)-(5\\ln2-2\\ln4)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\frac{5^5}{19^2}-\\ln\\frac{2^5}{4^2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\frac{3125}{361}-\\ln2=\\ln\\frac{3125}{722},\\quad\\text{as required.}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.23-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>The diagram below shows part of the curve with equation</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\ny=\\frac{4x^2+6x+2}{(x+2)(x^2+2)},\\qquad x\\ne-2.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span><figure class=\"diagram\"><img src=\"assets/2.23/questions/assets/diagrams/223q9.png\" alt=\"Original mathematical diagram\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><p>Find the exact value of the shaded area.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{4x^2+6x+2}{(x+2)(x^2+2)} \\equiv\\frac A{x+2}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+2},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n4x^2+6x+2 =A(x^2+2)+(Bx+C)(x+2).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2=2A+2C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"12=3A+3B+3C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"30=6A+8B+4C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{4x^2+6x+2}{(x+2)(x^2+2)}=\\frac1{x+2}+\\frac{3x}{x^2+2}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{4x^2+6x+2}{(x+2)(x^2+2)}\\,dx\n =\\int\\left(\\frac1{x+2}+\\frac{3x}{x^2+2}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln|x+2|+\\frac32\\ln|x^2+2|+c\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\left|(x+2)(x^2+2)^{3/2}\\right|+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4x^2+6x+2=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> or <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. The shaded-area limits are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_{-1/2}^0\\frac{4x^2+6x+2}{(x+2)(x^2+2)}\\,dx\n =\\left[\\ln\\left|(x+2)(x^2+2)^{3/2}\\right|\\right]_{-1/2}^{0}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln|4\\sqrt2|-\\ln\\left|\\frac{81}{16}\\right|\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\left(\\frac{16\\times4\\sqrt2}{81}\\right)=\\ln\\frac{64\\sqrt2}{81}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.23-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_4^6\\frac{(k-1)x^2-3kx-4}{(x-3)(x^2+4)}\\,dx=\\ln\\left(\\frac{32}{3}\\right).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{(k-1)x^2-3kx-4}{(x-3)(x^2+4)} \\equiv\\frac A{x-3}+\\frac{Bx+C}{x^2+4},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n(k-1)x^2-3kx-4 =A(x^2+4)+(Bx+C)(x-3).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-4=4A-3C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Compare linear terms: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-3k=C-3B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Compare quadratic terms: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k-1=A+B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{(k-1)x^2-3kx-4}{(x-3)(x^2+4)}=-\\frac1{x-3}+\\frac{kx}{x^2+4}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int\\frac{(k-1)x^2-3kx-4}{(x-3)(x^2+4)}\\,dx\n =\\int\\left(\\frac{kx}{x^2+4}-\\frac1{x-3}\\right)dx\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac k2\\ln|x^2+4|-\\ln|x-3|+c\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\left|\\frac{(x^2+4)^{k/2}}{x-3}\\right|+c.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_4^6\\frac{(k-1)x^2-3kx-4}{(x-3)(x^2+4)}\\,dx\n =\\left[\\ln\\left|\\frac{(x^2+4)^{k/2}}{x-3}\\right|\\right]_4^6\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\left|\\frac{40^{k/2}}3\\right|-\\ln|20^{k/2}|\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\left(\\frac{40^{k/2}}{3\\times20^{k/2}}\\right).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Compare with the given <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\ln(32/3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{40^{k/2}}{20^{k/2}}=32\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad\\left(\\frac{40}{20}\\right)^{k/2}=32\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad2^{k/2}=32\\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad k=10.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]